  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Marco
    Text: I woke up to Adrianne sobbing and Avant consoling her. While he mobilized
      and spread the news, I stayed with her. Shortly after Allistair and Charles
      came out to see what the commotion was about.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: 1919691424312299089, guid: 3dc94aacbc1d6b94db175170fd85926c, type: 3}
